From 54a5e1207195190eb8db679015ee912cdf9f34e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: arnofrxdd <bazzukagaming317@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 22:24:51 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 03/18] fix(oauth): address PR review security and reliability
 feedback

- fix(alembic): fix migration chain down_revision for oauth2_client_credentials
- fix(cache): add single-flight Redis lock with cache re-check inside lock
- fix(cache): treat missing expires_in as 0 (unknown expiry) so tokens without explicit lifetime are not cached
- fix(tools): initialize credential to None in custom_tool and transfer_resolver to prevent UnboundLocalError on 401 responses
- fix(auth): reject empty required fields in OAuth2 credential validation and raise ValueError in credential_auth
- fix(webhook): propagate OAuth token fetch errors as httpx.RequestError so webhook delivery retries instead of sending unauthenticated requests
- fix(auth): add shared invalidate_and_rebuild_auth helper for 401 retry recovery across tools and webhook delivery
- fix(credentials): validate credential_data whenever not None (including empty dict {})
- fix(compat): import TypedDict from typing_extensions for Python <3.12 compatibility
- test: add unit tests for missing expires_in and webhook OAuth token fetch retry
